=====================================================
ARCHITECTURE RULES
=====================================================

- API Gateway is the only entry point for clients.
- All backend services register with Eureka Discovery Server.
- All inter-service communication uses REST APIs with Spring WebClient.
- Do NOT use OpenFeign.
- Do NOT use Redis, Kafka, RabbitMQ, Docker, Kubernetes, JWT, OAuth, React, Angular, Vue, or Node.js.
- Each microservice owns its own PostgreSQL schema.
- No service may access another service's database directly.
- Use layered architecture (Controller → Service → Repository → Database).
- Use DTOs for API communication.
- Apply SOLID principles and clean architecture.
- Design the system for scalability and maintainability.

